   "tagline": "The AI manager that watches all my other AI automations.",
   "description": "I built an agent whose job is managing everything else on my machine. Every 30 minutes it sweeps every automation, repairs what it safely can, and only texts me when a human is genuinely needed; every morning it writes a brief and keeps a board of every project and its next step. The trick is cost: the sweep is plain Python, so a healthy machine costs zero tokens and a model only wakes up for a new problem.",
