   "description": "I built a tiny Swift status line for Claude Code that shows each session's state as an Iron Man-style arc reactor: dim cyan when idle, white-hot amber breathing while working, magenta when it's waiting on me, red on error. Claude Code only redraws the status line once a second, so I designed it to breathe instead of spin, with frames derived from the wall clock. It renders in about 9 ms, which matters when six sessions are open.",
